---
import { sitePath } from "../../lib/site-path";
---

<section class="final-cta site-section" aria-labelledby="final-cta-title">
  <div class="site-page">
    <p class="site-kicker">Your runtime, your rules</p>
    <h2 id="final-cta-title">这是你的运行空间。</h2>
    <p>从源码运行 ActSpace，检查每一层边界，再把它改造成适合你的 Agent 工作台。</p>
    <div>
      <a class="site-button site-button--primary" href={sitePath("/docs/getting-started/")}>开始使用</a>
      <a class="site-button" href="https://github.com/WakeUp-Jin/actspace-agent" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">在 GitHub 查看 ↗</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .final-cta {
    text-align: center;
    background: var(--site-canvas);
  }

  .final-cta :global(.site-kicker) {
    justify-content: center;
  }

  h2 {
    margin-block: 28px 22px;
    font-size: clamp(58px, 8vw, 104px);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.075em;
    line-height: 0.98;
  }

  p:not(.site-kicker) {
    max-width: 660px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    color: var(--site-body);
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.75;
  }

  .final-cta div {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin-top: 34px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 520px) {
    .final-cta div {
      align-items: center;
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .final-cta :global(.site-button) {
      width: min(100%, 300px);
    }
  }
</style>
